# Core layer

Long-form: `.agents/rules/core-layer.md`

- Registries live under `src/core/registry/`; features contribute via `FeatureConfig`.
- Router layouts: `appLayoutRoute` (auth), `authLayoutRoute`, ungated `/` in `layouts.tsx`.
- Assembly: `assembleRoutes` after `bootstrapFeatures` — do not register routes ad hoc in App.
- New Redux slice → wire reducer in `src/core/store/index.ts` (auth is the only slice today).
- Shell nav (home): `src/core/shell/sidebar.ts` — feature nav stays in feature `sidebar.ts`.
- Prefer not expanding `core` → `features` imports beyond existing auth coupling.
